    The style also hides DocuSeal's sales links in the account menu (Console). Modification of DocuSeal 3.3.8 (AGPL-3.0); source: https://github.com/warlock9k00/docuseal-saccade. The Saccade logo is its owner's trademark and is not licensed under AGPL. %>
<span id="saccade-nav-brand" class="flex items-center" style="gap:10px">
  <span class="flex items-center" style="gap:10px" role="img" aria-label="Saccade Media House"><img src="/saccade-media-house-logo.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="195" height="30" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto"></span>
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="width:1px;height:22px;background:currentColor;opacity:.18;margin:0 4px"></span>
  <span class="flex items-center opacity-70" style="gap:5px">
    <%= render 'shared/logo', width: '16px', height: '16px' %>
    <span class="text-sm font-semibold">DocuSeal</span>
  </span>
</span>
<style>
  .dropdown-content li:has(>a[href*="console.docuseal"]){display:none}
  @media (max-width:420px){#saccade-nav-brand .text-sm{display:none} #saccade-nav-brand img{width:auto!important;height:18px!important}}
</style>
